    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Months, seasons and dates",
     "texto": [
      "Months are written with a **lowercase** letter and take **a** or **in**: **a luglio** or **in luglio**.",
      "Seasons: **in primavera**, **in estate** (in summer), **in autunno**, **in inverno**.",
      "The date is said with the article and the normal number, without «of»: **il 3 dicembre** (the 3rd of December). Only the 1st is different: **il primo maggio**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
